Replace Nested Conditional with Guard Clauses, Separation of Query from Modifier (via self-encapsulation and private methods), Encapsulate Field, Encapsulate Collection, Extract Method (for validation and update logic), Replace Loop with Pipeline (using dict comprehension in list_employees), Introduce Explaining Variable (validated via _has_valid_employee_info), Consolidate Duplicate Conditional Fragments (combining the two loops in update_employee into validation + update), Add Parameter (none removed, but structure improved)
